{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe day has been a strange succession of images. Yesterday at Saint-Cloud, the Seine moved with a quiet dignity, a reminder that nature does not rush to its own end. But tonight, I sat in the theatre for a ballet that defied all logic. The subject was a sleepwalker found in a nobleman’s bed, later seen crossing a roof with a lantern. It was a spectacle of pure appearance, where the body moves without the will’s direction. The first act was danced; the rest was merely mimed. It struck me as a perfect allegory of the undetermined spirit, drifting through the ethical sphere without conscious intent.\n\nI am tired, but my mind is active. The absurdity of the performance, the stillness of the river, the heat of the evening—they all press against each other. I hope Karl and Immanuel are well. I miss your steady presence here in Berlin.\n\nYour loving,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795080561,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":201,"prompt_tokens":932,"total_tokens":1133,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-1LKkeMbhXLXCzG0GGKgKNO0dCC0eJzRP","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":932,"prompt_ms":915.297,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9820783261802576,"prompt_per_second":1018.2487214532549,"predicted_n":201,"predicted_ms":4750.445,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.752225,"predicted_per_second":42.10131892906875}}